Hence, the following:
NC: 2023:KHC:29385 ORDER (i) The appeal is allowed in part;
(ii) The petitioner is entitled to an enhanced compensation of Rs.1,19,000/- along with interest at the rate of 6% p.a. from the date of petition before the Tribunal till realization which shall be over and above what has been awarded by the Tribunal;
(iii) Respondent No.3-Insurance company shall pay the enhanced compensation within a period of six weeks from the date of receipt of the certified copy of the judgment and order;
(iv) Office to draw modified award accordingly.

